{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_7","type":"agent_message","text":"The join change applies only to the JVM stdin path; headless mode and its timed signal hook are unchanged. The drain has a 201-tick limit once the shell stops. I’m checking what can delay the queued `(quit)` before that limit starts, and how the test collects the child’s output."}}
